/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1017:front.shopping.payment_modal.credit.li1: ・Visa
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1018:front.shopping.payment_modal.credit.li2: ・JCB
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1019:front.shopping.payment_modal.credit.li3: ・Mastercard
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1020:front.shopping.payment_modal.credit.li4: ・American Express
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1021:front.shopping.payment_modal.credit.li5: "・Diner's Club"
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1022:front.shopping.payment_modal.credit.notes: "Your credit card statement will show \"Hareruya\" as the merchant name.<br>※Installment payments are not supported. Only lump-sum payment is available.<br>※We cannot change payment methods from other options to credit card.<br>※Combined shipping is not available for orders paid by credit card."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1023:front.shopping.payment_modal.cod.title: "●Cash on Delivery<br>Cash on delivery is available via Japan Post. The cash on delivery fee is based on the total payment amount (product price + shipping + COD fee) as follows.<br>※We cannot change payment methods from other options to cash on delivery.<br>-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-"
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1024:front.shopping.payment_modal.cod.fee1: "¥0 – under ¥30,000 ・・・ ¥330"
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1025:front.shopping.payment_modal.cod.fee2: "¥30,000 – under ¥100,000 ・・・ ¥550"
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1026:front.shopping.payment_modal.cod.fee3: "¥100,000 – under ¥200,000 ・・・ ¥880"
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1027:front.shopping.payment_modal.cod.fee4: "¥200,000 – under ¥300,000 ・・・ ¥990"
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1028:front.shopping.payment_modal.cod.fee5: "¥300,000 – under ¥500,000 ・・・ ¥1,430"
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1029:front.shopping.payment_modal.cod.notes: "-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-<br>※Cash on delivery is a payment method where the delivery carrier collects payment upon delivery.<br>※Please pay the total amount (including shipping and COD fee) in cash to the delivery carrier.<br>※If a package is not received and returned after the holding period, an additional shipping fee may be charged.<br>※An additional COD fee applies on top of the standard shipping fee.<br>※Shipping will be via Yu-Pack.<br>※Combined shipping is not available for orders using cash on delivery."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1030:front.shopping.payment_modal.convenience.title: "●Convenience Store Payment<br>Payment can be made at the following convenience stores."
